# Helitrooper, Fervent Champion and Knight of Grace attack. Helitrooper's trigger targets the Knight ("another target
# attacking creature"; the Champion was the other candidate), and so does the Champion's ("another target attacking
# Knight you control", the Knight its only candidate). Bot2 bolts the Knight in response: both triggers find their only
# target gone and do nothing (CR 608.2b). The Champion (1/1, first strike) and Helitrooper (1/2, flying) deal 2.

